nd the new?", "x0": 0.1207464324917673, "y0": 0.13675213675213677, "x1": 0.3413830954994512, "y1": 0.14763014763014762}, {"text": "In your response, refer to TWO of your prescribed texts and ONE related text of your", "x0": 0.12184412733260154, "y0": 0.1623931623931624, "x1": 0.8660812294182217, "y1": 0.1825951825951826}, {"text": "own choosing.", "x0": 0.12184412733260154, "y0": 0.18492618492618493, "x1": 0.24588364434687157, "y1": 0.1989121989121989}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction \u2014 Italo Calvino, [fon a Winters Night a Traveller", "x0": 0.1942919868276619, "y0": 0.2338772338772339, "x1": 0.7936333699231614, "y1": 0.2602952602952603}, {"text": "\u2014 Ursula Le Guin, The Left Hand of Darkness", "x0": 0.3567508232711306, "y0": 0.2703962703962704, "x1": 0.7628979143798024, "y1": 0.28438228438228436}, {"text": "\u2014 Jonathan Swift, Gulliver s Travels", "x0": 0.3567508232711306, "y0": 0.29914529914529914, "x1": 0.677277716794731, "y1": 0.3123543123543124}, {"text": "+ Poetry Samuel Taylor Coleridge, Samuel Taylor Coleridge:", "x0": 0.1942919868276619, "y0": 0.35664335664335667, "x1": 0.8320526893523601, "y1": 0.3706293706293706}, {"text": "The Complete Poems", "x0": 0.3809001097694841, "y0": 0.3752913752913753, "x1": 0.5631174533479693, "y1": 0.38927738927738925}, {"text": "* The Rime of the Ancient Mariner (1834)", "x0": 0.42371020856201974, "y0": 0.3962703962703963, "x1": 0.8035126234906695, "y1": 0.4226884226884227}, {"text": "* The Eolian Harp", "x0": 0.42590559824368823, "y0": 0.4219114219114219, "x1": 0.6004390779363337, "y1": 0.4358974358974359}, {"text": "* Kubla Khan", "x0": 0.42590559824368823, "y0": 0.44133644133644134, "x1": 0.557628979143798, "y1": 0.4522144522144522}, {"text": "* Christabel", "x0": 0.42590559824368823, "y0": 0.45998445998445997, "x1": 0.5455543358946213, "y1": 0.47086247086247085}, {"text": "\u2014 Tracy K Smith, Life on Mars", "x0": 0.36223929747530187, "y0": 0.4988344988344988, "x1": 0.6443468715697036, "y1": 0.5128205128205128}, {"